WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.997
The final Python step translates some quality rules
into code We inspect

00:00:06.023 --> 00:00:12.378
missingness verify identifier uniqueness test simple
validity rules and review category frequencies

00:00:14.127 --> 00:00:20.011
Assertions are useful for teaching because they make
a rule explicit Production

00:00:20.038 --> 00:00:27.331
pipelines usually need richer logging and exception
handling but the principle is the same Quality

00:00:27.357 --> 00:00:30.094
rules should be documented and checked consistently
